# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# gdmerge: semantic 3-way merge for Godot scenes and resources
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep these two lines in the exact form written by `gdmerge git-install` so
# that command recognises them and only configures the local driver.
# The attributes are committed; each clone still needs gdmerge + one
# `gdmerge git-install` run so Git knows what the "gdmerge" driver executes.
*.tscn merge=gdmerge
*.tres merge=gdmerge
